msgstr "**Di build and verification** Di script create temporary Conda environment from di warehouse `environment.yml`Di , skip user-configured default package, and install PyInstaller for di site. Dem collect dependncies for directory mode. Di build explicitly include FFmpeg, FFprobe, bundled algorithms, and resources and publish di archive after its extract copy pass di self-check."

