msgstr "But e no dey run **Di desktop package** Di single commit to compare packagers Di native platform build Conda and PyInstaller onedir tar.xz archives and tests di extracted GUI, video, built-in algorithm and export Di job summary record di verified download size for bytes Di custom algorithm wey you plan to distribute."

